  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity building entrepreneurship for three universities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project envisioned to support the ecosystem for entrepreneurs in Algeria, through building capacity at three Algerian universities in the field of entrepreneurship.The project supported a business school in Algeria and two universities in Oran individually to integrate entrepreneurship in their strategy and practices, in order to stimulate more students to start their own business. Interventions focused on teaching methods, pre- or extracurricular activities, student-led events, strategy review or other forms of support.To make the capacity building tailor-made and context specific for every university, the project started with a needs assessment which lead to a concrete implementation plan for each of them.</narrative>
  </description>
